{"title":"The Devil Doesnt Bargain","artist":"Alec Benjamin","sourceId":"reference:0OuR7t3wPaaJajl5wkpD","sourceHash":"1b176e56acbad0f178f613bf4331f9964127f0c6cd2c967846e864a432f04e91","performanceStatus":"no_performance_record","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","cues":[{"id":"1","start":0.29,"end":3.29,"text":"The devil doesn't bargain","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":8.98,"end":11.98,"text":"It's useless, don't do this, it's hubris to try","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":12.87,"end":15.87,"text":"He's ruthless, you knew this, I told you, didn't I?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":16.55,"end":19.55,"text":"He's abusive, elusive, the truth is he lies","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":20.6,"end":23.6,"text":"I know you don't want to let go","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":24.73,"end":27.73,"text":"And just like before, I can see that you're sure","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":28.44,"end":31.44,"text":"You can change him, but I know you won't","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":31.66,"end":34.66,"text":"The devil doesn't bargain, he'll only break your heart again","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":35.69,"end":38.69,"text":"It isn't worth it, darling, he's never gonna change","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":39.68,"end":42.68,"text":"He'll never be Prince Charming, he'll only do you harm again","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":43.7,"end":46.7,"text":"I don't mean to meddle, but the devil doesn't settle","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":47.29,"end":49.76,"text":"No, the devil doesn't bargain","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":49.76,"end":51.44,"text":"Mm, mm, mm, mm","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":51.44,"end":53.89,"text":"The devil doesn't bargain","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":53.89,"end":56.49,"text":"Mm, mm, mm, mm","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":56.49,"end":59.49,"text":"I'm not one to lecture, talk down to a friend","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":60.33,"end":63.33,"text":"I don't mean to pressure, mean to condescend","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":63.9,"end":66.9,"text":"But I just want what's best for you in the end","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":68.26,"end":71.26,"text":"I know you don't want to let go","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":72.1,"end":75.1,"text":"And just like before, I can see that you're sure","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":75.87,"end":78.87,"text":"You can change him, but I know you won't","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":79.28999999999999,"end":82.28999999999999,"text":"The devil doesn't bargain, he'll only break your heart again","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":83.24,"end":86.24,"text":"It isn't worth it, darling, he's never gonna change","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":87.1,"end":90.1,"text":"He'll never be Prince Charming, he'll only do you harm again","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":91.31,"end":94.31,"text":"I don't mean to meddle, but the devil doesn't settle","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":94.89,"end":97.00999999999999,"text":"No, the devil doesn't bargain","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":97.00999999999999,"end":98.92,"text":"Mm, mm, mm, mm","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":98.92,"end":101.1,"text":"The devil doesn't bargain","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":101.1,"end":104.1,"text":"Mm, mm, mm, mm","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":104.93,"end":107.93,"text":"And I know you think he'll change this time","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":